# Governance ownership: the policy source of truth, its compiler and the
# promotion pipelines are owned by @rckosai-dev. Product teams propose changes
# via PR (see the comments in policy/service-catalog.yaml).
#
# This is a personal-account repo, so code owners must be individual GitHub
# users with write access (GitHub teams, @org/team-slug, exist only under an
# Organization). To hand ownership to a platform/observability *team*, move the
# repo into an Organization, create the team, then replace the owners below with
# its @org/team-slug. Add more users by listing them on a line: `/path @a @b`.
#
# NOTE: CODEOWNERS only auto-requests review. To enforce it, enable a branch
# protection rule on `main` with "Require review from Code Owners"
# (Settings -> Branches).

/policy/                     @rckosai-dev
/policy-compiler/            @rckosai-dev
/collector/config/           @rckosai-dev
/prometheus/rules/           @rckosai-dev
/.github/workflows/          @rckosai-dev
/deployments/                @rckosai-dev
